F3 area). I will move my"},{"seq":921,"t":4800,"type":"courier","id":"c297","house":"kite","letter":"L332","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":4800,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":922,"t":4800,"type":"courier","id":"c298","house":"kite","letter":"L333","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":4800,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":923,"t":4800,"type":"courier","id":"c299","house":"kite","letter":"L334","kind":"order","to":"kite-cav-1","path":["kite-camp"],"depart":4800,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":924,"t":4800,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1569,"retries":0},{"seq":925,"t":4800,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Doctrine dictates taking F1 early, which is done. Now must hold F1 with foot/ele and send orders doubly. No immediate threats, so reinforce F1 and prepare to secure other fords if possible."},{"seq":926,"t":4800,"type":"courier","id":"c300","house":"orchid","letter":"L335","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1"],"depart":5100,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":"AEQRT AKKT, DKHS BT WMRT AKQS."},{"seq":927,"t":4800,"type":"courier","id":"c301","house":"orchid","letter":"L336","kind":"order","to":"orchid-ele-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1"],"depart":5100,"plain":"ELEPHANTS, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":"MHMNDBJTR, DKHS BT WMRT AKQS."},{"seq":928,"t":4800,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1943,"retries":0},{"seq":929,"t":4800,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"Tiger holds F3 (East Ford) with strong units. Rhino/Kite pressure at F3 (5w ago). Doctrine: Take East Ford first 5 watches. Now at W17. Must hold F3 and secure another ford. Moving archers/cavalry to F3 to reinforce/maintain hold. Moving Ele to secure F1/S-West area."},{"seq":930,"t":4800,"type":"courier","id":"c302","